{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#card-zh","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 是面向 DSH 网页端的可复用提示词库，在 Settings 中提供管理页面，并在聊天输入区加入提示词选择器。用户可以创建、编辑、删除和搜索指令，按会话勾选要注入的内容，也能设置新会话默认启用项；未单独选择的子 agent 会继承最近祖先会话的选择。选中的指令会作为运行时上下文供模型步骤使用。适合需要跨会话复用工作规范、语气或任务指令的 DSH 用户。保存内容需要可写的 profile settings 文件，不需要额外 API key。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1303-1310","client.js:1394-1437","client.js:1691-1751","index.js:276-330"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#card-en","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib adds reusable prompts to DSH web. Edit them in Settings, then search and select instructions per chat. New chats can use defaults; subagents inherit the nearest ancestor's selection. Chosen text enters model context. Saving needs writable profile settings; no API key.","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1303-1310","client.js:1394-1437","client.js:1691-1751","index.js:276-330"]}
