{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#feature-1","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 的功能「提示词管理」：在 Settings → Prompts 中创建、编辑、删除指令并设置新会话默认项。填写标题和正文后保存到插件配置。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1303-1310","client.js:1394-1437"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#feature-2","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 的功能「会话选择器」：在聊天输入区打开 Prompts 面板，搜索并勾选要使用的提示词；选择按当前会话保存，也可清空。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:958-987","client.js:1033-1085","client.js:1740-1750"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#feature-3","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 的功能「会话上下文注入」：模型组装步骤时读取当前会话所选指令，将正文合并成运行时上下文；未选内容时不注入文本。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:304-330","index.js:371-386"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#feature-4","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 的功能「子 agent 继承」：会话没有自己的选择时，沿 parentSession 查找最近祖先的提示词选择；整条会话链都没有选择时采用默认项。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:253-290"]}
{"unit_id":"Stmol__dsh-prompt-lib#caveat-1","repo":"Stmol/dsh-prompt-lib","commit":"fc6dd22fd2855b18dd55cd01238680a76b20bc8d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"@stmol/dsh-prompt-lib 使用前须知：DSH profile 的 settings 文件必须可写，提示词和会话选择才能保存；写入失败时页面会显示错误。（见 client.js:119-122）","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:119-122","client.js:651-655"]}
